<title>UK: Hanson seeks share consolidation go-ahead.</title>
<headline>Hanson seeks share consolidation go-ahead.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-U.S. conglomerate Hanson Group said on Tuesday it would ask shareholders at an extraordinary general meeting on February 21 to approve the consolidation of Hanson shares.</p>
<p>The consolidation, on the basis of one new Hanson share for eight existing shares, was aimed to reduce the number of shares to a level more appropriate to Hanson's size following its extensive demerger, the company said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
